# Compendium packs and the distilled rules are NOT distributed.
# The rulebook designates its setting material — species and ship names, organisations —
# as Product Identity rather than Open Game Content, so the packs, their sources and the
# rules digest stay local until the rights question is settled. They remain on disk and
# the system loads them normally; they are simply not published.
packs/
docs/rules/
